        "markdown": "# Graph-Defined Handles\n\nThe top endpoint inherits the Declaration HTML Handle. The middle Port overrides it with SVG. The bottom Port overrides it with Canvas. Each visual is transparent and passive; drag from the same endpoint hotspot to verify the separate interaction target."
